# STATION 4: give, take, has, count, and a narration line for each.
npc: @test_items
title: Station 4 - Items
speaker: Tester

== start
TEST 4: Items. You currently hold {count("Food_Bread")} bread. Expected: this number changes as you use the options below.
-> Give me 2 bread (expect a grey "You receive 2 Bread" line and +2 in your inventory)
    <<give Food_Bread 2>>
    <<jump start>>
-> Take 1 bread (expect "You hand over 1 Bread"; if you have none, expect a "You don't have" line) 
    <<take Food_Bread 1>>
    <<jump start>>
-> Only visible while I hold at least 3 bread <<if has("Food_Bread", 3)>>
    Correct: has("Food_Bread", 3) is true.
    <<jump start>>
-> Greyed out until I hold 5 bread <<show if has("Food_Bread", 5)>>
    Correct: you had five or more.
    <<jump start>>
-> Leave
    <<end>>
